SUMMARY:The Talking Hearts: Honky Tonk Dance & Album Release Party
LOCATION:Parlor Room\, 32 Masonic St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:The Talking Hearts are a cutting-edge honky tonk band from Bost
 on. Channeling the spirit of country music icons Loretta Lynn\, Buck Owens
 \, and George Jones\, the Talking Hearts play witty and relatable original
  songs written by fiddler Rachel Rosenberg about folks who’ve done her w
 rong. Their lively performances showcase the thick three-part harmony sing
 ing of Rachel\, Zach Meyer (mandolin)\, and Sophie Wellington (guitar)\, w
 hile bassist Dan Bui and drummer Mike Harmon lay down an infectious rhythm
 ic groove and Alex Formento adds that sweet lonesome texture on pedal stee
 l. Founders and hosts of the Burren Backroom’s monthly Honky Tonk Tuesda
 y\, the Talking Hearts will get you two-stepping in no time against a back
 drop of their catchy originals and favorite classic country gems. Pull up 
 your cowboy boots and get ready for a rollickin’ good time!\nhttps://the
 parlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000Bwfm1MAB\nFro
 m Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV50000
 0Bwfm1MAB
END:VEVENT
