SUMMARY:Ali McGuirk
LOCATION:Parlor Room\, 32 Masonic St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:Ali McGuirk has never been a church mouse. In fact\, these days
 \, she’s standing at the pulpit. “I feel like I'm writing lyrics that 
 are preaching\,” McGuirk said with a laugh\, realizing in real time how 
 much her voice as an artist has evolved while writing and arranging her la
 test album\, Watertop. “I’m actually delivering a message\, not necess
 arily processing my feelings\, but delivering my thoughts on the matter. T
 hat felt like a different role to embody as a songwriter.”\nhttps://thep
 arlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000CeRvaMAF\nFrom
  Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
