SUMMARY:CANCELLED - Splendid Torch plays Fleetwood Mac
LOCATION:Parlor Room\, 32 Masonic St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:Splendid Torch is not following a trend. With their sensitivity
 \, suppleness\, power & pure skill\, they’re redefining Americana. Splen
 did Torch\, inspired by classic country and their past experience in tradi
 tional music\, brings indie sensibility to their heartfelt –and at times
  unusual– songs. Fronted by vocalist Lily Sexton\, they are proudly clai
 ming their place in the lineage of prominent\, genre-defying women\, calli
 ng to mind Emmylou Harris\, The Roches\, & Sheryl Crow.\nhttps://theparlor
 room.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000CbtbKMAR\nFrom Push
